<tr><td>Sotish va baham ko‘rishdan voz kechish</td><td>Reklama maqsadida baham ko‘rishdan voz kechish (AQSh)</td><td>privacy@anacan.az yoki GPC signali</td></tr>
<tr><td>Shikoyat</td><td>Nazorat organiga shikoyat berish</td><td>10.3-bandga qarang</td></tr>
